A||||7||Jncomutt||Help!  Smoke Streaming through vents!||||1||
Z||000000||Jncomutt||05-19-2001||11:55 AM||||Ok, Heres the problem.  I was driving home last night with the "vent" on and the slider to the cold side.  I was getting cool so I moved the slider over to hot.  Just then I smelt smoke and then it started to pour out of the vents and come up through the defroster.  I moved the switch back to cold and it stopped.<P>I have an 84 with A/C with those push button controls.<P>Anyone ever have this problem, or at least know what the heck is goin on here??||||reg||1
Z||000001||Joe4x4||05-19-2001||12:49 PM||||sounds like to be the Heater Core.<P>------------------<BR>Need For Speed........<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/car1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jncomutt||05-19-2001||01:09 PM||||Hmm... Just went outside and was playing with the controls. Tried everything and moved from cold to hot, thing didn't smoke this time...||||reg||1
Z||000003||c m west||05-19-2001||01:12 PM||||HEATER CORE!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||sluppy123||05-19-2001||01:13 PM||||I'll second the heater core idea. It'a located behind a panel under the dash on the pass side. remove 4 or 5 screws and you can see if it's leaking.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>87' GT-Galaxy silver mettalic, Eibach springs, RSM side scoops, Mr Mikes leather, 70hp NOS, 17" Mille Miglia's, and lots more.<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=12781563&p=48213929&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||theogre||05-19-2001||01:19 PM||||You smelled smoke, not the yucky sweet coolant small.... You probably got some trash in the heater speed resistor pack.<P>A good way to prevent that, after cleaning out the system and the intake area under the grate (in front of the windshield).....<P>Take up the grating and find the inlet to the heater system. cut some 1/4 or finer mesh and make a cover for that inlet. The grate below the winshield has some rather large openings in it. Doing this prevents things that get by it from getting into the heater.||||reg||1
Z||000006||grinthock||05-19-2001||02:55 PM||||I third the motion of heater core.. .on one condition<P>if it filmed up your window and you can't just WIPE it off cause it smears alot then it's coolant leaking from the heatercore||||reg||1
Z||000007||Fierowrecker||05-19-2001||04:10 PM||||Hey Mutt!<BR>You got MICE!<BR>Had the same problem, burned out a blower motor...<BR>Pulled the motor and found a mouse nest in the heater box, preventing the motor from running...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
